hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1550","Al-Rabi’ bin Sulayman Al-Muradi told me, Ibn Wahb told me, Osama told me, on the authority of Uthman bin Urwa bin Al-Zubayr, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Aisha, On the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “Indeed, God and His angels send blessings upon those who pray in rows.”"
